  "details": "It would be really handy to be able to choose the name of the project folder when doing a migration/backup. Currently the process is:\n1. Migrate and back up the project.\n2. Open folder.\n3. Remove it from the list in VCC.\n4. Rename the folder.\n5. Add it back to the VCC.\nPretty annoying and round-about when we could just get a textbox to choose a new name when backing up (or maybe just a feature to rename in general).",
